    "body": "The link you gave is to an outdated fork of the HTML Standard that is often modified by introducing bugs that do not match browsers (see https://annevankesteren.nl/2016/01/film-at-11). Would you mind checking if the issue is present in the actual HTML Standard that we work on in this repository?",
